-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 6, §6.20 שאילה והשאלת מורים
-- The special collective agreement of 15.8.82 on teachers who teach in both
-- divisions of a six-year school, each division with its own employer:
-- which employer is the "lending employer" who employs the teacher in full,
-- the lent teacher's rights, the lending and the accounting between the
-- employers, non-permanent teachers, commencement, and disputes.
-- The corpus keeps of the agreement's annexes only lines 3.2, 3.4, 4.1 and
-- 4.4 of annex א, as headings; they are encoded as far as they go.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `6.20 שאילה והשאלת מורים`

@desc The parties to the agreement and the others it gives roles to. None of them is among the takanon's shared parties, so they are declared here.
DECLARE `6.20 party` IS ONE OF
    `party A` @desc the Government of Israel, for the State: employer of the middle division's teachers
    `party B` @desc the Centre for Local Government (for all local authorities but the three big cities) and the three big cities: employer of the upper division's teachers
    `party C` @desc the Teachers' Union and the Organisation of Post-Primary School Teachers
    `the principal`
    `the teacher`
    `the Ministry`
    `a joint committee of the parties in dispute`
    `the district treasurer and the local authority's representative`

@desc The two divisions of a six-year school.
DECLARE `division` IS ONE OF
    `the middle division` @desc grades 7, 8, 9
    `the upper division`  @desc grades 10, 11, 12

@desc A teacher of a six-year school, as far as the agreement asks.
DECLARE `six-year teacher` HAS
    `permanent with party A`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `permanent with party B`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed first by`              IS A MAYBE `6.20 party` @desc the employer who employed the teacher first; NOTHING if hired by both at the same time
    `position with party A over the period` IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's average position fraction with party A over the period 4.2ב examines
    `position with party B over the period` IS A NUMBER
    `years since starting work`      IS A NUMBER

@desc What section 4 of the agreement determines for a teacher.
DECLARE `lending determination` IS ONE OF
    `lent by` HAS `the lending employer` IS A `6.20 party`
    `the teacher chooses either employer`
    `the agreement does not apply`

DECLARE `6.20 action` IS ONE OF
    `assign a teacher to a division`
    `endeavour to place the teacher in one division`
    `endeavour to place the teacher at a third of a position in one division`
    `convene the joint committee`
    `approach a non-party employer to join`
    `settle the accounts between the employers`
    `delay or impair a teacher's rights over the accounting`
    `check the lists against the attendance report`
    `assign teachers to both divisions, by the school's needs and with regard to the teachers' wishes`
    `keep to employing the teacher in the upper division for half of all his hours in the school`
    `update the list of six-year schools as more open`
    `update the rate for a teaching hour, every year on a date the employers agree`

§§ `6.20 המבוא`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p2 The section's title.

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p3
`the day the agreement was signed` MEANS "15.8.1982 (כ\"ו במנחם אב התשמ\"ב)"

-- ¶4: an owner of a six-year school that did not sign and wants to be
-- included must sign a letter of accession (section 8(2) of the Collective
-- Agreements Law), in annex ג's form, in 4 copies by registered mail.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p4
GIVEN `signed the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN, `signed the accession letter` IS A BOOLEAN, `copies sent by registered mail` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the owner is included in the agreement` `signed the agreement` `signed the accession letter` `copies sent by registered mail` IF
       `signed the agreement`
    OR (`signed the accession letter` AND `copies sent by registered mail` AT LEAST 4)

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p5 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p6 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p7 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p10 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p14 The lines that open the agreement's text and join its parties ("בין", "לבין").

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p8 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p9 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p11 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p12 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p13 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p15 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p16 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p17
`the parties to the agreement` MEANS LIST `party A`, `party B`, `party C`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p18 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p19
GIVEN d IS A `division`
GIVETH A `6.20 party`
DECIDE `employer of the division` d IS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the middle division` THEN `party A`
    WHEN `the upper division`  THEN `party B`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p20
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the six-year school is one pedagogical and administrative unit` IF TRUE

-- ¶21 and ¶23: some of the school's teachers teach in both divisions, and
-- such a teacher is employed, subject to the agreement, by one employer only.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p21 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p23
`employers of a teacher who teaches in both divisions, subject to this agreement` MEANS 1

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p22
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `assigning teachers to the divisions` IS
    PARTY `the principal`
    MAY   `assign teachers to both divisions, by the school's needs and with regard to the teachers' wishes`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p24 The words that introduce the agreed clauses ("לפיכך הוסכם").
-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p25 Clause 1 makes the preamble and annexes part of the agreement; that is why the recitals above are encoded as rules.

§§ `6.20 סעיפים 2–3`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p26 The heading of clause 2.

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p27
GIVEN `on the list of six-year schools kept in the Ministry's treasury` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies to the school` `on the list of six-year schools kept in the Ministry's treasury` IF
    `on the list of six-year schools kept in the Ministry's treasury`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p28
GIVEN `more six-year schools open` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `updating the list of schools` `more six-year schools open` IS
    IF `more six-year schools open`
    THEN PARTY `the Ministry`
         MUST  `update the list of six-year schools as more open`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry` BECAUSE "clause 2: the list is updated from time to time as more six-year schools open"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p29 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p30 The heading of clause 3 and its opening words ("בהסכם זה:").

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p31
GIVEN `permanent as is customary in the education system` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a permanent employee` `permanent as is customary in the education system` IF
    `permanent as is customary in the education system`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p32
GIVEN p IS A `6.20 party`, d IS A `lending determination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is the lending employer, who employs the teacher in his whole position by clause 4, under` p d IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `lent by` e THEN e EQUALS p
    OTHERWISE FALSE

§§ `6.20 סעיף 4 מדדים לקביעת מעסיק משאיל`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p33 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p35 The headings of clause 4 and of 4.2.

-- 4.2ב–ג look at the last four years before the determination, or at the
-- time since the teacher started if that is shorter.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p37
GIVEN t IS A `six-year teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years examined` t IS
    min 4 (t's `years since starting work`)

-- 4.2ג's "10 percent" difference between the two positions. Read as ten
-- points of a full position (F-6.20-a); the other reading measures it
-- against the larger position.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p38
GIVEN t IS A `six-year teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the positions are equal or within 10 points` t IF
    max (t's `position with party A over the period` MINUS t's `position with party B over the period`)
        (t's `position with party B over the period` MINUS t's `position with party A over the period`)
    AT MOST 10%

GIVEN t IS A `six-year teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the positions are equal or within 10 percent of the larger` t IF
    max (t's `position with party A over the period` MINUS t's `position with party B over the period`)
        (t's `position with party B over the period` MINUS t's `position with party A over the period`)
    AT MOST 10% TIMES max (t's `position with party A over the period`) (t's `position with party B over the period`)

-- 4.1, 4.2א–ג and 8.1. 4.2ג is the exception to 4.2ב's majority rule it
-- follows from: where the examination finds the positions equal or close,
-- the teacher chooses.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p34 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p36 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p38 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p47
GIVEN t IS A `six-year teacher`
GIVETH A `lending determination`
DECIDE `the lending employer` t IS
    BRANCH
        IF t's `permanent with party A` AND NOT t's `permanent with party B`
        THEN `lent by` `party A`
        IF t's `permanent with party B` AND NOT t's `permanent with party A`
        THEN `lent by` `party B`
        IF (NOT t's `permanent with party A`) AND (NOT t's `permanent with party B`)
        THEN `the agreement does not apply`
        OTHERWISE
            CONSIDER t's `employed first by`
            WHEN JUST e THEN `lent by` e
            WHEN NOTHING THEN
                IF `the positions are equal or within 10 points` t
                THEN `the teacher chooses either employer`
                ELSE IF t's `position with party A over the period` GREATER THAN t's `position with party B over the period`
                     THEN `lent by` `party A`
                     ELSE `lent by` `party B`

-- F-6.20-a: the two measures of "10 percent" decide differently.
`hired by both together, 0.50 and 0.44` MEANS
    `six-year teacher` WITH
        `permanent with party A`                IS TRUE
        `permanent with party B`                IS TRUE
        `employed first by`                     IS NOTHING
        `position with party A over the period` IS 0.50
        `position with party B over the period` IS 0.44
        `years since starting work`             IS 6

`the two measures of 10 percent decide differently` MEANS
        `the positions are equal or within 10 points` `hired by both together, 0.50 and 0.44`
    AND NOT `the positions are equal or within 10 percent of the larger` `hired by both together, 0.50 and 0.44`
#ASSERT `the two measures of 10 percent decide differently`

-- 4.3: once determined, a change in the teacher's hours does not change
-- it, provided the hours in the lending employer's classes stay at a third
-- of a position or more (lender A) or at half of all the teacher's hours in
-- the school or more (lender B); and 4.3ג keeps B as lender of a permanent
-- teacher whose upper-division hours fell below half for the school's
-- needs. What happens otherwise is not said (F-6.20-b).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p38
GIVEN lender IS A `6.20 party`
      `position in the lender's classes` IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's position fraction in the lending employer's classes now
      `share of the school hours in the lender's classes` IS A NUMBER @desc the share of all the teacher's hours in the school that are in the lending employer's classes now
      `fell for the school's needs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the determination stands` lender `position in the lender's classes` `share of the school hours in the lender's classes` `fell for the school's needs` IS
    BRANCH
        IF lender EQUALS `party A` AND `position in the lender's classes` AT LEAST 1/3
        THEN JUST TRUE
        IF lender EQUALS `party B` AND `share of the school hours in the lender's classes` AT LEAST 1/2
        THEN JUST TRUE
        IF lender EQUALS `party B` AND `fell for the school's needs`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

`a lender A teacher down to a quarter of a position` MEANS
    `the determination stands` `party A` (1/4) (1/4) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a lender A teacher down to a quarter of a position`

-- 4.3ב: for a teacher whose lending employer is party B, the principal
-- keeps to the aim of employing him in the upper division for half of all
-- his hours in the school.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p38
GIVEN lender IS A `6.20 party`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `keeping a B-lent teacher at half in the upper division` lender IS
    IF lender EQUALS `party B`
    THEN PARTY `the principal`
         MUST  `keep to employing the teacher in the upper division for half of all his hours in the school`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the principal` BECAUSE "clause 4.3ב"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `6.20 סעיף 5 זכויות מורה מושאל`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p39
GIVEN d IS A `lending determination`
GIVETH A MAYBE `6.20 party`
DECIDE `who employs the lent teacher for every purpose, from the lending on` d IS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `lent by` e THEN JUST e
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p39
`what the lending employer owes the lent teacher` MEANS
    LIST "the salary, with every pay component, allowance and reward the teacher is owed for the work",
         "severance pay or pension, as the case may be",
         "all social and professional rights"

§§ `6.20 סעיף 6 סדרי השאלה, התחשבנות ותיאום`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p40 The heading of clause 6.

-- 6.1: the lending employer lends the teacher to the other for the hours
-- the teacher teaches in the other's classes.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p41
GIVEN `hours in the other employer's classes` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours lent` `hours in the other employer's classes` IS
    `hours in the other employer's classes`

-- Annex א, 4.1: the lending employer is owed the hours taught at the other
-- employer times the rate for a teaching hour (6.2 sends the accounting to
-- annex א).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p41 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20__ssec_4_1
GIVEN `hours taught at the other employer` IS A NUMBER
      `rate for a teaching hour` IS A NUMBER @desc agreed between the employers and updated yearly on a date they agree (annex א, 4.4)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `owed to the lending employer` `hours taught at the other employer` `rate for a teaching hour` IS
    `hours taught at the other employer` TIMES `rate for a teaching hour`

-- Annex א, 3.4: the accounts are settled in September each year on the
-- previous year's report. Time in school months from the start of the
-- reported year: September of the next is month 13.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20__ssec_3_4
GIVEN employer IS A `6.20 party` @desc party A or party B
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `the yearly accounting` employer IS
    PARTY employer
    MUST  `settle the accounts between the employers`
    WITHIN 13
    LEST  BREACH BY employer BECAUSE "annex א 3.4: the accounts between the employers are settled in September on the previous year's report"

-- Annex א, 4.4: the rate for a teaching hour is updated every year, on a
-- date the two employers agree.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20__ssec_4_4
GIVEN employer IS A `6.20 party` @desc party A or party B
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `updating the hourly rate` employer IS
    PARTY employer
    MUST  `update the rate for a teaching hour, every year on a date the employers agree`
    LEST  BREACH BY employer BECAUSE "annex א 4.4"

-- Annex א, 3.2: the district treasurer and the local authority's
-- representative check "the lists" against the school's attendance report.
-- The lists are those of the annex's earlier lines, which the corpus does
-- not keep.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20__ssec_3_2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `checking the lists` IS
    PARTY `the district treasurer and the local authority's representative`
    MUST  `check the lists against the attendance report`

-- ¶42: the accounting is no concern of party C, and may not delay or impair
-- the teachers' rights under the agreement.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p42
`whose concern the accounting is` MEANS LIST `party A`, `party B`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p42
GIVEN p IS A `6.20 party`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `the accounting does not touch the teachers' rights` p IS
    PARTY p
    SHANT `delay or impair a teacher's rights over the accounting`
    LEST  BREACH BY p BECAUSE "clause 6.2: the accounting between the employers may not delay or impair the teachers' rights"

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p43
GIVEN `party A agrees` IS A BOOLEAN, `party B agrees` IS A BOOLEAN
      `made with regard to the teacher's wish and the principal's opinion, by the school's needs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a change in the lending's scope or its cancellation is made` `party A agrees` `party B agrees` `made with regard to the teacher's wish and the principal's opinion, by the school's needs` IF
        `party A agrees`
    AND `party B agrees`
    AND `made with regard to the teacher's wish and the principal's opinion, by the school's needs`

§§ `6.20 סעיפים 7–8`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p44 The heading of clause 7.

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p45
GIVEN `signed the consent letter` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies to the lent teacher` `signed the consent letter` IF
    `signed the consent letter`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p46 The heading of clause 8.

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p48 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p49
GIVEN t IS A `six-year teacher`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `placing a non-permanent teacher` t IS
    IF `the lending employer` t EQUALS `the agreement does not apply`
    THEN PARTY `the principal`
         MUST  `endeavour to place the teacher in one division`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST  (PARTY `the principal`
                MUST  `endeavour to place the teacher at a third of a position in one division`)
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `6.20 סעיפים 9–12`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p50 The heading of clause 9.

-- 9.1: in force from 1.9.1982, and for teachers whose salaries were unified
-- under the agreement of 4.2.1975 — those who retired on 31.8.1982 too —
-- back to the day the salary was first unified.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p51
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
      `salary was unified under the 1975 agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day the salary was first unified` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies to the teacher on` `the day` `salary was unified under the 1975 agreement` `the day the salary was first unified` IF
       DATE_SERIAL `the day` AT LEAST DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1982)
    OR (    `salary was unified under the 1975 agreement`
        AND DATE_SERIAL `the day` AT LEAST DATE_SERIAL `the day the salary was first unified`)

-- 9.1, second paragraph: for this, the employer with whom the salary was
-- unified is the lending employer.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p52
GIVEN `salary was unified under the 1975 agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employer that unified the salary` IS A `6.20 party`
      `the determination otherwise` IS A `lending determination`
GIVETH A `lending determination`
DECIDE `the lending employer, counting a unified salary` `salary was unified under the 1975 agreement` `employer that unified the salary` `the determination otherwise` IS
    IF `salary was unified under the 1975 agreement`
    THEN `lent by` `employer that unified the salary`
    ELSE `the determination otherwise`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p53
GIVEN `lending period began before 1.9.1982` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period is accounted for between A and B` `lending period began before 1.9.1982` IF
    NOT `lending period began before 1.9.1982`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p54
GIVEN `the agreement is in force` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1975 salary-unification agreement is in force` `the agreement is in force` IF
    NOT `the agreement is in force`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p55 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p57 akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p59 The headings of clauses 10, 11 and 12.

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p56
GIVEN `covered by the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN, `the agreement gives a solution` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the special committee handles the teacher` `covered by the agreement` `the agreement gives a solution` IF
    `covered by the agreement` AND NOT `the agreement gives a solution`

-- 11: a dispute between the parties over the agreement's application,
-- meaning or performance, or anything else arising from it, is settled in a
-- joint committee of the parties to it, which meets within a month of
-- either one's request. Time in days from the request.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p58
GIVEN `a party to the dispute requested it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `a dispute between the parties` `a party to the dispute requested it` IS
    IF `a party to the dispute requested it`
    THEN PARTY `a joint committee of the parties in dispute`
         MUST  `convene the joint committee`
         WITHIN 30
         LEST  BREACH BY `a joint committee of the parties in dispute` BECAUSE "clause 11: the joint committee convenes within a month of a party's request"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 12: employers of six-year school teachers who are not parties may join
-- by signing the letter of accession in annex ג; the Ministry approaches
-- them and asks them to join.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p60
GIVEN `signed the letter of accession in annex ג's form` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a non-party employer joins as a party` `signed the letter of accession in annex ג's form` IF
    `signed the letter of accession in annex ג's form`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p60
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.20 party` `6.20 action`
DECIDE `inviting employers to join` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry`
    MUST  `approach a non-party employer to join`

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_20/p61 The heading of the annexes; the lines the corpus keeps of annex א are encoded above with clause 6.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples (placeholder teachers and rates).
`permanent with A only` MEANS
    `six-year teacher` WITH
        `permanent with party A`                IS TRUE
        `permanent with party B`                IS FALSE
        `employed first by`                     IS NOTHING
        `position with party A over the period` IS 0.6
        `position with party B over the period` IS 0.4
        `years since starting work`             IS 10

`hired by both together, 0.7 and 0.3` MEANS
    `six-year teacher` WITH
        `permanent with party A`                IS TRUE
        `permanent with party B`                IS TRUE
        `employed first by`                     IS NOTHING
        `position with party A over the period` IS 0.3
        `position with party B over the period` IS 0.7
        `years since starting work`             IS 2

#ASSERT `the lending employer` `permanent with A only` EQUALS `lent by` `party A`
#ASSERT `the lending employer` `hired by both together, 0.7 and 0.3` EQUALS `lent by` `party B`
#ASSERT `the lending employer` `hired by both together, 0.50 and 0.44` EQUALS `the teacher chooses either employer`
#ASSERT `years examined` `hired by both together, 0.7 and 0.3` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `owed to the lending employer` 120 50 EQUALS 6000

#TRACE `a dispute between the parties` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a joint committee of the parties in dispute` DOES `convene the joint committee` AT 20
#TRACE `the accounting does not touch the teachers' rights` `party B` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `party B` DOES `delay or impair a teacher's rights over the accounting` AT 3
